:"2026-08-31T09:47:01Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33379371792/job/99447970509","name":"homebrew","startedAt":"2026-08-31T09:47:02Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"}],"title":"🐛 Projects: re-fetch stale boards on activation and show their age"}
